    <string name="ai_master">AI Assist</string>
    <string name="ai_master_on">On: what you ask goes to Mistral, an AI service on the internet.</string>
    <string name="ai_master_off">Off: nothing goes to any AI service; Tetra works with no internet company at all.</string>
    <string name="ai_master_note">Off, AI Assist and every ✦ button are hidden and no request leaves the device. It is the same on all your devices.</string>
